  "notes": "Interim 100-card mono-blue Commander deck for the Foundations Keen Engineering precon (official list unreleased; Ruling M3-P). Commanded by Sai, Master Thopterist: every artifact spell makes a 1/1 Thopter and {1}{U} sac-two-artifacts draws, so the deck is a critical mass of cheap artefacts (thirty-plus) feeding Skullclamp and the sac outlets. Interaction is blue's classic tempo suite (Counterspell, Mana Leak, Remand, Exclude plus the bounce family), draw is Ponder/Brainstorm/Impulse/Thirst and friends, and the top end (Solemn Simulacrum, Master of Etherium, Hangarback Walker, Sharding Sphinx, Steel Hellkite) closes through air. Colour identity is exactly blue: the only off-colour cards are colourless-identity artifacts and lands.",
